# GPU firmware must be in the FIRST-STAGE initramfs.
#
# DRM_MSM is built in, and on a7xx the adreno driver loads its SQE microcode
# at component-bind time, about 1.4 s into the boot and long before the
# rootfs is mounted. The X800 port found a miss there costs the GPU for the
# whole boot: msm registers display-only and nothing retries later (see the
# gts8pwifi copy of this file).
#
# SQE + GMU come from linux-firmware-qcom (zstd-compressed; the kernel has
# FW_LOADER_COMPRESS_ZSTD). The zap shader is Samsung-signed and comes from
# the tablet's own stock firmware (NON-HLOS.bin / apnhlos), staged into
# /lib/firmware by hand and never by a package, so those entries carry
# !optional: a rootfs build without the staged zap must not fail, but the
# resulting initramfs boots a display-only msm.
/lib/firmware/qcom/a730_sqe.fw.zst
/lib/firmware/qcom/gmu_gen70000.bin.zst
/lib/firmware/qcom/sm8450/gts8uwifi/a730_zap.mdt!optional
/lib/firmware/qcom/sm8450/gts8uwifi/a730_zap.b00!optional
/lib/firmware/qcom/sm8450/gts8uwifi/a730_zap.b01!optional
/lib/firmware/qcom/sm8450/gts8uwifi/a730_zap.b02!optional
